    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 7220,
      "text": "Developing ideas. Activity 1. Listen to the radio."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 8200,
      "end_ms": 11680,
      "text": "What's the biggest problem for new students?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 13460,
      "end_ms": 19400,
      "text": "Welcome to Students Union Radio. The new school year is beginning."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 20280,
      "end_ms": 24780,
      "text": "What are the new students' problems? Let's take a look."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 24780,
      "end_ms": 32960,
      "text": "For many students the biggest problem is they have more subjects and more homework."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 33620,
      "end_ms": 40560,
      "text": "They also have many activities. So how can they make good use of their time?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 41880,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "The Students Union will hold a talk this Thursday to help you. Come and join us."
    }
  ],
